<p>Connect your Paybill or Till number in <strong>Settings → Integrations → M-Pesa</strong> with the Daraja API keys from Safaricom's developer portal.</p>

<h2>Payment prompts</h2>
<p>At the till, choose M-Pesa and enter the customer's phone number. They get a prompt on their phone for the amount, enter their PIN, and the sale completes itself when Safaricom confirms. If it doesn't go through, the till says why.</p>

<h2>Money paid straight to your Paybill or Till</h2>
<p>When a customer pays by Lipa na M-Pesa themselves, the payment appears on the till within seconds. Pick it to pay the sale. Payments whose account number is an order reference or a customer's account number are matched to that order or account automatically.</p>

<h2>Reconciliation</h2>
<p><strong>Reports → M-Pesa</strong> lists every payment Safaricom reported and what it was matched to, so anything unmatched stands out.</p>
